<div class=WordSection1>

<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span style='font-size:12.0pt'>FAQs</span></u></b> :-</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Q1: Does it cost anything to list a product online?</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>A: No, there are absolutely no charges to list your products
on BidForSale.com. It is a free online marketplace open to everyone.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Q2: Does BidForSale.com charge a commission?</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>A: Yes, BidForSale.com charges a commission from sellers
only. The specific percentage will be mentioned in the seller's agreement.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Q3: Can I post more than one product?</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>A: Yes, users can post as many products as they wish.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Q4: How long will my items stay online?</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>A: Your products will remain online for as long as you
choose to keep them there.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Q5: How many photos can I upload for each item?</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>A: You can upload upto 5 photos for each item.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Q6: Why aren’t my items showing up immediately after I
submit them?</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>A: All items are screened before publication. Once your
items are approved, you will receive a notification, and they will go live on
the site.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Q7: Why would my post be rejected?</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>A: Posts may be rejected or need correction if they do not
comply with our guidelines:</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>i) Photos must not be copied from other websites.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>ii) The product should be clearly visible in the photos.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>ii) Items described inaccurately will be rejected.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>iv) If your item is refurbished, please specify this
clearly.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>If a product is rejected, the seller can adjust the post to
meet these guidelines and resubmit.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Q8: Do I need to inform BidForSale.com when someone
purchases my item or shows interest?</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>A: No, the transaction process is entirely online. Both
seller and buyer will receive notifications via email about any updates.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Q9: What is Product Bidding/Negotiation?</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>A: BidForSale.com allows sellers to label their item prices
as negotiable, which enables buyers to place bids. Sellers have the option to
accept or reject these bids.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Q10: Will I receive a tax invoice when I buy a product?</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>A: Yes, buyers will receive a tax invoice for any purchases
made.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Q11: Is Cash on Delivery available?</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>A: Yes, Cash on Delivery (COD) is available, along with
online payment options.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Q12: What is BFS?</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>A: BFS (BidForSale) is a dedicated marketplace for luxury
products, available to both individual and corporate users. It features an
exclusive selection of items on both the website and app. BFS is an e-commerce
platform that includes all necessary features to conduct successful online
transactions, including a direct payment gateway to sellers' bank accounts upon
order completion.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Q13: How can I trust that I will get paid after sending my
item?</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>A: Payment is guaranteed based on the provided details. An
email confirmation will be sent after the order is successfully completed. We
are committed to providing a risk-free selling experience and aim to become the
largest e-commerce portal in India through customer satisfaction.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Q14: Does Bid For Sale have a customer care number?</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>A: Yes, Bid For Sale offers a dedicated customer service
number that users can call directly.</p>

